types.description:
TimeseriesTypeAnnotation opts a message into timeseries table generation.
 tacplus generates store-neutral conversion helpers and a gRPC service from
 messages annotated with this option. Each annotated message produces one
 timeseries table type. Retention and dedup are declared as semantic intent;
 a downstream materializer renders the concrete engine/TTL/merge behavior.

 Example:
   message SensorTimeseries {
     option (spec.timeseries_type) = {source: "sensor.SensorEvent"};
     ...
   }

 This is a GENERATOR-INTERNAL compile target: tacplus emits it from every
 (spec.transformation). It carries no retention — retention is delivery-side
 state and lives on (spec.record).retention.

